<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Six steel stocks cut, one raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Six steel stocks cut, one raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for six steel stocks to neutral from buy and raised Birmingham Steel Corp to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut Weirton Steel Corp, Rouge Steel Co, WHX Corp, LTV Corp, Inland Steel Industries Inc and National Steel Corp.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
